{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Root cause confirmed against the current Codex manual: documented USER discovery is HOME/.agents/skills and symlinked skill folders are supported. Existing links were valid but located at HOME/.codex/skills. Current session metadata still ingests that legacy/internal location, explaining the mismatch between agent catalog and the user-visible skill selector."},"env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1786115463844097001,"uuid":"0b641c5c-aaf9-408a-aa62-ddc9269b5c37"}